{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Pre-sweep against origin/main 7927904a0. Every number was re-derived by listing tests/scripts/ at depth 1 and AST-diffing each pair's top-level definitions, not sampled.\n\nConfirmed correct: 10 base/_heldout pairs under tests/scripts/; zero colliding test-function names across all 10; exactly 7 pairs carry non-test definitions with differing bodies, and the 7 modules are precisely the ones the Approach listed. tests/scripts/test_check_config_reads_red_proof.py is the only *_red_proof.py module and has no twin, so leaving it alone is right.\n\nThree corrections applied:\n1. The unpaired count was wrong and would have failed AC1's own parenthetical. Scope and AC1 both said '4 unpaired tests/scripts/ held-out modules'. The tree holds exactly one: test_canary_status_refs_heldout.py. The other three have already been dealt with, so an implementer reconciling against '4' would have gone looking for modules that do not exist. Both mentions now name the single surviving module.\n2. The Approach said '7 renames' and then listed 7 module names. Those are pairs, not renames: the 7 pairs carry 13 differing definitions. The Approach now states 13 definition renames over 7 pairs and enumerates all 13 against their modules, so the rename set does not have to be re-derived.\n3. AC3 required check_mechanism_delta.py --check to show new=0. That is unmeetable and has nothing to do with this story's work: new=N counts marker-admitted entries, so a clean tree already reports a nonzero new and exits 0. Amended to assert exit 0, the gate's real pass signal. Root cause is bug 6f24-3d47-b251-4905, which has now landed a fix in AGENTS.md and rebar explain plan.\n\nThe measurement pin was also repinned from the stale origin/main 083620b0 to 7927904a0, with the method recorded so a later reviewer can tell a re-measurement from a sample."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793479052445036001,"uuid":"ad7cb40b-d952-43c7-b8ff-13b8b3063176"}